# What's on Kids Drum sing Dance June 30th

Join us for some Drum Sing Dance FUN these holidays! We have lots of drumming, singing and dancing and you all get the chance to be the star of the show with your very own creation! That's right.... this time round we would love for you to make your very own drum!! We want colours, sounds.. the whole lot! So, grab some of your mummas tupperware, dads rope, or an old pot and your own creative touch and the winner will receive a prize! Yay!! See you all very soon for some rocking fun! Do you want to [learn more](/drumming-workshops/drum-sing-dance-workshops/) or [book in now](/product/drum-sing-dance-workshops/)? **All welcome! The Girl Guides Hut** **Crn Palmwoods-Montville Rd and Lingara Ave June 30th 10am**
